        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom old-style bungalow on approx. 1 acre\nLocated in a very pleasant rural area on an elevated site, this 1950s-style bungalow needs total renovation but has the potential to be a beautiful home after a restoration project.\n\nVacant for a number of years, it should qualify for a number of vacant/derelict home grants, subject to inspections.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.2 x 2.7m\nBedroom 1 - 3.6 x 3.6m\nBedroom 2 - 3.6 x 3m\nBedroom 3 - 3.3 x 2.3m\nDining Area / Bedroom 4 - 3.3 x 2.9m\nCentral Living Room - 4.3 x 3.7m - Solid Fuel Stove\nKitchen / Utility Area - 3.4 x 3.1m\nBathroom Area - 3.1 x 2m\n\nLocation\nApprox. 2 miles from Aclare village in Co. Sligo and 5 miles from Swinford in Co. Mayo, this is a very secluded yet convenient property. It should appeal to many seeking a smallholding for ongoing holistic purposes.\n\nServices\n\nElectricity\nSeptic tank\nPrivate well water\n\nOptional Extra Land\nThe house adjoins a larger farm extending to approx. 74 acres, which we are also offering for sale through the same owners. The old sheds plus some land can be sold with the house, subject to price negotiations.\n\nThe land adjoining and optional with the house is generally of good and mixed quality and could be ideal for general farming or forestry project purposes.\n\nFull details on extra options available upon request.\n\n"
      }
    ],
